{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんこんばんは。\n新内眞衣です(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月も明日で終わり〜〜！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年はあんまりレインブーツを\n履いていないのですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雨が少ないのかな？？？\nそれともこれからなのかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"通勤時、雨が降ってると\n本当に会社に行きたくなくなるのですが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"レインブーツがあると幾らか\n気持ちがましになります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なので、全国の雨が嫌いなOLさん！\nレインブーツ、オススメです！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"電車の中の傘とかも足が濡れる\n原因になるんでね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年迷ってる方は是非とも\n買ってみて下さいね〜〜(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTB"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"UTB発売中です〜〜(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めてのUTBさんで\nなんと10ページも載せて頂きました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エプロンしてたり\n屋上にいたり\nお花を持ってたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、、、\nいろんな私がいるので、\n是非お手にとってみて下さいね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bayFM 金つぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"金曜日はみさ先輩の代打で\n金つぶ生放送に出ました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生放送ということで\nめちゃめちゃ緊張して\n噛み噛みでしたが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小島さんがとてもいい人で\nたくさん助けられて\n楽しい放送になりました(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"課題もたくさん見つかったし\nとても良い経験！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いていてくれた方\nMailを送ってくれた方\nありがとうございました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"放送しながら座談会が出来て\nとっても楽しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週からはまたみさ先輩に戻ります♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎週水曜 24時〜の\nまいちゅんカフェもよろしくね♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ数日、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"12枚目の作品が続々と公開\nされていますが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遂にMVも解禁されました〜〜！\nもう見てくれたかな？？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初選抜曲ということで\n私にとってはとても大切な楽曲です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チラチラ映ってるので探して\n見て下さいね〜〜(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感想待ってます♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【連絡】"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会での浴衣は\n京都も名古屋も着ます(*^_^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"要望があれば季節ハズレの\n関東でも着ます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年の夏はお祭りに行けなさそう\nなので、\n握手会でたくさん着る作戦！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非浴衣を見て涼みに来てくださいね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/blog/mai.shinuchi/img/2015/06/29/8878748/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は何色着ようかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺で〜〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また書きます(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"}],"source":"archive"}